 "intro_texte": "These are some of the most viral motion graphics on the internet right now. This music video has 2.5 million views, and it was posted by a student with 1,600 followers. This one was a remake of it, almost 4 million views. And this one, every drum hits time freezes and the camera flies around her. Today, you're going to learn how to make this because this one is mine. Actually, I made two. One that is paid and one that cost $0. And everything that you see here was done by AI. My claude was the director if it thought of every shot and how to pull it off. And even the song that you see, the melody, the lyrics, every single sound here was generated by AI. Everything you see here is basically code. And of course, as you know me, I turned all of it into a skill. It's free. And you have two options. You can either use the paid one or you can use the $0 one. And by the end of this video, you will see exactly what are the differences between the paid one and the $0 one. I'm actually super excited to make this video because today",
 "fin_texte": "a bit of space. So, you got to make sure you have space for that. And if you're on the pro, uh, start definitely with a shorter video like 30 seconds, not a full song. And to the motion designers in my comments who said is really bad. I get it. And honestly, a lot of AI motion graphics do look the same. same center attacks, same gradients, but that's because nobody's directing it today. I direct it. Claude did the work. I decided what's good and what's mid. And I'm not an expert. So if you are a motion graphic expert, you could definitely have a way better skill than mine. So again, the skill is free in my school community link is in the description. Make your own video or song. I would love to see that in the school if you guys can post it and share it. Thank you so much for staying all the way to the end of this video. Seriously, it really helps me a lot. I It's just unbelievable that I gained 4,000 subscribers. Tell me in the comments which one do you like the more, the paid one or the $0 one? And if you haven't hit the follow, please do. and I'll see you on the next one.",
